  "clinical_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Take your time. What's your back been doing?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:46",
      "end_timestamp": "00:50",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It aches. Down low, on the right side. Not all the time, but when I bend over to do the garden it's quite... well, it catches me.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:52",
      "end_timestamp": "01:05",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint",
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Okay. When did the backache begin, roughly?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:06",
      "end_timestamp": "01:10",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Oh dear. That's the thing. I couldn't tell you. It might have been around Christmas, or perhaps before that, in the autumn? I really can't say.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:13",
      "end_timestamp": "01:25",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Have you had any falls at all in the last year?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:46",
      "end_timestamp": "01:51",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No, none. I'm very careful, I hold on to the banister, and I've got those mats with the grips in the bathroom.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:54",
      "end_timestamp": "02:05",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, osteoporosis, that's what they called it. The doctor before you said I should have been on something for it by now, but I never... I wasn't happy with it.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:19",
      "end_timestamp": "02:34",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I think I had a reaction. I'm fairly sure I'm allergic to one of the bone tablets, I took it once for a short while. But I couldn't tell you which one, or what happened exactly.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:42",
      "end_timestamp": "03:01",
      "supports": [
        "allergies[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "That's right. I remember feeling poorly. And my sister said I was ever so upset about it. But whether it was a rash, or my tummy, or... I'm sorry.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:16",
      "end_timestamp": "03:28",
      "supports": [
        "allergies[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, there's one spot of tenderness over the lower spine on the right. Everything else moves nicely. You can sit back down.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:14",
      "end_timestamp": "05:23",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "You haven't done anything. Here's where I am. The ache could simply be a strained muscle. But with thin bones, I can't rule out a small crack in one of the vertebrae.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:32",
      "end_timestamp": "05:46",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's helpful to know. In the meantime, gentle walking is good for bone, and foods with calcium, like yoghurt, cheese and green leafy vegetables. Keep using the grip mats and the banister.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:57",
      "end_timestamp": "07:14",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "For once, I'd side with your cheese habit. Please also bend from your knees, not your back, when you're in the garden.",
      "start_timestamp": "07:22",
      "end_timestamp": "07:32",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "They'll wait. Next, can I ask you to find out from your sister what that tablet was, or whatever she remembers about it?",
      "start_timestamp": "07:41",
      "end_timestamp": "07:53",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Good. Then I'd like to see you again in six weeks, once we know more, and we'll choose a treatment together.",
      "start_timestamp": "08:03",
      "end_timestamp": "08:13",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[2]",
        "follow_up[0]"
      ]
    }
